## Architecture — Layered MVC with Service Layer



```

Request

  │

  ▼

Router          ← defines URL, applies middleware (auth, validation, rate limit)

  │

  ▼

Controller      ← reads req, calls service, sends response — NO business logic here

  │

  ▼

Service         ← ALL business logic, DB queries, error throwing

  │

  ▼

Model           ← Mongoose schema, indexes, hooks

  │

  ▼

MongoDB

```



**The most important rule:** Business logic lives in **Services only**.

Controllers are thin wrappers. They do three things: read input, call service, return response.



